### Test: Registro de nuevo egresado con todos los campos
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan",
  "apellido": "Pérez",
  "dni": "12345678",
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

